{
  "suite": "lookup_approx_whole_axis",
  "description": "An approximate lookup (MATCH type 1, LOOKUP, VLOOKUP with TRUE) bisects a whole-column reference over its declared length, the blank cells past the populated ones included. On a column that is not sorted the whole column and the bounded reference to the populated cells probe different rows: here the whole-column bisection reaches C4 (a small value after larger ones) while the bounded one stops at C1.\n",
